{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-91947ce96c0791dd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Run comparison view in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tai_signals:\n10\t  change_specificity: 0\n11\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n12\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n13\t  existing_foundation: 1\n14\t  open_questions: 1\n15\t  external_dependency: 1\n16\t  human_process_gates: 1\n17\t  repo_access: 1\n18\t  architecture_claims: 1\n19\timplementation_type: null\n20\tdependencies: []\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 7\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view in the Dashboard\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tDeliver a run comparison capability in the Dashboard: users can select two or more training or pipeline runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side, with a diff presentation that highlights which parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs. This gives data scientists in-platform visibility into what changed between candidate runs, replacing comparison via exported spreadsheets and supporting model promotion decisions.\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Multi-select of two or more runs from the runs list in the Dashboard.\n38\t- Side-by-side view of the selected runs' parameters and metrics.\n39\t- Diff presentation between two selected runs, highlighting which parameters and metrics differ (added, removed, or changed values).\n40\t- Comparison covers both training runs and Data Science Pipelines runs, reading run parameters and metrics through the interfaces the Dashboard already uses to surface runs.\n41\t- Comparison is an additional view: no changes to run execution, run storage, or the existing behavior of the run list and run detail pages.\n42\t\n43\t## Acceptance Criteria\n44\t\n45\t- Given a list of runs, when the user selects two or more runs, then the Dashboard offers a comparison action that opens a side-by-side view of those runs' parameters and metrics.\n46\t- Given a comparison of exactly two runs, then the view highlights which parameters and metrics differ between them.\n47\t- Given a selection that includes Data Science Pipelines runs, then their parameters and metrics are presented in the comparison the same as training runs (passive validation of the Data Science Pipelines component — no code change in that component).\n48\t- Given a selected run with missing parameters or metrics, then the comparison renders the missing values without breaking the view.\n49\t- The existing run list and run detail pages continue to function unchanged.\n50\t\n51\t## HLR Traceability\n52\t\n53\t- HLR-1 (P0): users can select two or more runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side in the Dashboard.\n54\t- HLR-3 (P1, consolidated with HLR-1): a run diff view highlighting which parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs — a presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the same run data, delivered in this epic.\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-aee6e6abde0081a0","agent_id":"ab1af650465ed2dd3","session_id":"d7f44887-6b51-4892-b0d7-5d5cd7144188","uuid":"b38ba139-2d2b-48eb-8687-7c17a936d7d4","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:10:24.779Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-91947ce96c0791dd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
