5\t\n46\t- Given a registered model version that carries a producing-run link, when the user views it in the Dashboard's registry UI, then an action is available to open a comparison that includes the producing run.\n47\t- Given a comparison opened from the registry, then it presents parameters and metrics side by side with diff highlighting between two selected runs, matching the comparison opened from the runs list.\n48\t- Given a model version without a producing-run link, then the registry view degrades gracefully with no user-facing error.\n49\t\n50\t## HLR Traceability\n51\t\n52\t- HLR-2 (P1, Dashboard side): a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry.\n53\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-aee6e6abde0081a0","agent_id":"ab1af650465ed2dd3","session_id":"d7f44887-6b51-4892-b0d7-5d5cd7144188","uuid":"70cfffd3-7016-42cf-af99-f404a8ce722a","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:10:28.446Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8482dc85a2d46014","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
